1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,070
Clouds hide glacial lakes, just when they fill.

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:09,030
In 2022, the Shisper lake outburst destroyed a Karakoram Highway bridge.

3
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:13,550
We're SARcastic Scientists from Islamabad. We built SARtale.

4
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:16,658
